\newlabel{fig:trees}{{1}{1}{Partitions of a Cinema frame at quantizer 64 of 1023. Keyframe RD trees of the three codec families follow content: small blocks along the ridges and in the textured hills, large blocks in the smooth sky. The RD tree of a predicted frame (bottom middle) follows prediction error instead and leaves most of the hills in large blocks. The keyframe tree carried along the motion vectors (bottom right) follows content again}{figure.caption.2}{}}
